{"type":"text","timestamp":1780922500068,"sessionID":"ses_158bf74b5ffex1PSjVN9fQN6HZ","part":{"id":"prt_ea740c386001wcUwKpwpNWgRMQ","messageID":"msg_ea7408c64001ugGQvrmDMcF517","sessionID":"ses_158bf74b5ffex1PSjVN9fQN6HZ","type":"text","text":"I’ll perform the audit directly without dispatching subagents, since no tool here exposes the required `--rotate-provider opencode4` pin for nested runs. I’ll read the operator/reference inputs first, then inspect the full function inventory for files touched by the supplied diff and write only the requested report path.","time":{"start":1780922499974,"end":1780922500066},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f5b0591efe763ad016a26b883f198819ba6ee8c49fc9e7ef2","phase":"commentary"}}}}
